WEBVTT

00:13.710 --> 00:16.650
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:17.840 --> 00:20.490
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.490 --> 00:25.900
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.370 --> 00:30.920
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.470 --> 00:35.760
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:36.720 --> 00:40.270
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.260 --> 00:43.470
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.470 --> 00:46.510
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.510 --> 00:48.590
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.590 --> 00:52.650
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.160 --> 00:57.930
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:57.930 --> 01:02.220
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.220 --> 01:03.630
♪Over the time♪

01:03.630 --> 01:05.640
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:05.640 --> 01:08.490
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.490 --> 01:11.760
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:11.760 --> 01:16.460
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.160 --> 01:24.810
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.479 --> 01:42.840
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.270 --> 01:46.370
=Episode 36=

01:52.060 --> 01:52.539
You…

01:52.539 --> 01:53.460
You have betrayed Her Lordship.

01:53.860 --> 01:54.820
and the Yu clan.

01:55.180 --> 01:56.180
Why do you come here?

01:56.780 --> 01:57.259
Do you intend

01:57.700 --> 01:59.660
to wipe out the entire Yu clan?

02:03.460 --> 02:04.660
I came to find Shuo Xuan.

02:04.980 --> 02:06.460
Keep her name out of your mouth!

02:09.539 --> 02:10.699
I do not want to harm you.

02:12.660 --> 02:13.500
You are not allowed

02:14.340 --> 02:15.380
to trespass the Sea of Clear Skies.

02:15.900 --> 02:16.460
Young Lord.

02:25.620 --> 02:26.740
Young Lord, please follow me.

02:42.180 --> 02:43.020
What is going on?

02:58.579 --> 02:59.420
Shuo Xuan.

03:00.060 --> 03:00.300
You…

03:01.820 --> 03:03.660
After Her Lordship's true form
fell into a deep sleep,

03:05.260 --> 03:06.540
Shuo Xuan used Meditation Spell

03:07.620 --> 03:08.620
to replace Kun's consciousness

03:10.260 --> 03:11.500
and control her body.

03:12.740 --> 03:13.380
Yue Qi.

03:14.260 --> 03:15.100
You have finally come.

03:15.580 --> 03:16.820
Why do you want Rehai?

03:17.380 --> 03:18.180
Why?

03:18.860 --> 03:20.780
The reason lies above you.

03:40.180 --> 03:42.860
Many of our people
were injured in this battle

03:43.820 --> 03:45.140
and are recuperating here.

03:51.300 --> 03:53.300
I cannot make decisions regarding Rehai.

03:54.020 --> 03:55.540
But I will consult with Zhaoyan.

03:56.579 --> 03:57.340
You must not.

04:05.300 --> 04:05.980
Ying Xuwei.

04:06.820 --> 04:07.620
What are you here for?

04:08.380 --> 04:09.740
This has nothing to do with you.

04:10.100 --> 04:11.860
You shall not lay your hands on Rehai.

04:12.460 --> 04:14.900
Then I will send Kun to the human world.

04:15.980 --> 04:16.660
Don't.

04:16.899 --> 04:17.579
Shuo Xuan,

04:18.820 --> 04:20.260
let's just tell them

04:22.019 --> 04:23.580
the real reason.

04:26.380 --> 04:28.020
Her Lordship's consciousness
has fallen into slumber.

04:28.700 --> 04:30.500
Kun's body instinctively needs energy

04:31.300 --> 04:32.740
to heal the wounds from the battle.

04:36.140 --> 04:37.460
Repressing this instinct alone

04:38.940 --> 04:40.659
has already exhausted Shuo Xuan.

04:43.020 --> 04:44.260
Without the power of Rehai,

04:45.300 --> 04:47.180
eventually, she won't
be able to hold on.

04:48.220 --> 04:50.180
So you want the power of Rehai

04:51.020 --> 04:52.380
to cure Zhu Yu.

04:55.140 --> 04:57.420
Rehai can only provide temporary relief.

04:58.140 --> 04:58.900
If Kun

05:00.300 --> 05:01.740
cannot complete the transformation,

05:02.820 --> 05:03.660
your Yu Clan,

05:04.300 --> 05:05.140
including Zhu Yu,

05:06.220 --> 05:08.260
must enter the time stasis.

05:09.140 --> 05:09.780
Ying Xuwei.

05:10.500 --> 05:12.460
Do you want to see a catastrophe
in the human world again?

05:16.980 --> 05:17.900
I have an idea.

05:19.260 --> 05:20.060
Let's hear it.

05:21.380 --> 05:22.860
I possess the bloodline of Kun.

05:23.540 --> 05:25.780
I can provide my spiritual
power to Zhu Yu

05:26.140 --> 05:27.180
to calm her instincts.

05:28.460 --> 05:29.180
In this way,

05:29.940 --> 05:31.460
it will not affect the human world.

05:32.620 --> 05:33.659
Have you thought it through?

05:35.620 --> 05:37.020
Zhu Yu has been sleeping
for ten thousand years.

05:37.780 --> 05:39.500
Providing her with your spiritual power

05:40.180 --> 05:41.780
could be fatal to you.

05:42.940 --> 05:44.300
Not a bad way to make up.

05:47.020 --> 05:48.100
But I have a condition.

05:48.700 --> 05:49.780
The sleeping Yu Clan

05:50.060 --> 05:51.980
will enter the time stasis
together with Zhu Yu.

05:53.020 --> 05:54.100
The awakened Yu Clan

05:54.980 --> 05:55.900
may return to the sea.

05:56.580 --> 05:57.260
Yue Qi.

05:58.140 --> 05:59.140
- How dare you?
- Shuo Xuan.

05:59.740 --> 06:02.100
To seize Rehai to treat the Yu Clan,

06:02.420 --> 06:04.500
we harmed innocent humans.

06:04.660 --> 06:06.700
We cannot make the same mistake again.

06:10.580 --> 06:11.340
Even if we lose,

06:13.820 --> 06:14.700
our Yu Clan

06:18.020 --> 06:19.140
mustn't lose our dignity.

06:26.940 --> 06:27.620
Young Lord.

06:33.020 --> 06:33.659
Young Lord.

06:40.340 --> 06:41.420
I'm counting on you.

06:47.420 --> 06:48.900
I'm also responsible for the Yu Clan.

06:55.100 --> 06:55.820
Shuo Xuan.

06:57.659 --> 06:59.140
I didn't fulfill my duty
as the daughter.

07:00.580 --> 07:01.620
After this is settled,

07:03.100 --> 07:04.940
you should take over as the Young Lord.

07:05.580 --> 07:06.140
Yue Qi.

07:06.500 --> 07:07.340
What do you mean?

07:07.700 --> 07:08.660
Apologizing to the Yu Clan?

07:09.300 --> 07:10.220
Or did you realize

07:10.300 --> 07:11.660
they're your burden now?

07:11.980 --> 07:12.540
Shuo Xuan.

07:14.380 --> 07:15.980
I am Zhu Yu's daughter,

07:17.700 --> 07:19.300
but I've never lived among the Yu Clan.

07:20.580 --> 07:23.580
Shuo Xuan understands and
cares for them more than I do.

07:24.460 --> 07:25.620
She is more suitable for the role.

07:29.620 --> 07:30.220
Mr. Ying.

07:30.820 --> 07:31.980
What do you think of it?

07:40.260 --> 07:40.820
I agree.

07:45.380 --> 07:46.460
Then, we must trouble you

07:47.659 --> 07:49.140
to open the Mist Soul afterward.

08:27.100 --> 08:28.180
Young Lord!

08:30.820 --> 08:31.380
Thank you.

08:40.380 --> 08:41.140
Ying Xuwei.

09:10.100 --> 09:12.420
I will follow Her Lordship
into the time stasis.

09:15.500 --> 09:16.020
Shuo Xuan.

09:20.780 --> 09:21.900
Entering the time stasis

09:23.980 --> 09:24.900
equals eternal imprisonment.

09:29.140 --> 09:29.780
You are young.

09:35.820 --> 09:36.900
If we migrate to the sea,

09:38.340 --> 09:39.540
we can start over again.

09:43.020 --> 09:44.300
Her Lordship is our savior.

09:45.460 --> 09:46.900
I should stay by her side.

09:48.780 --> 09:50.420
I'm also doing you a favor

09:51.020 --> 09:52.340
by accompanying Her Lordship.

09:53.260 --> 09:54.460
From now on, we are even.

09:59.580 --> 10:00.860
I am willing to follow Her Lordship

10:01.820 --> 10:03.540
to the time stasis.

10:04.860 --> 10:06.740
I am willing to follow Her Lordship

10:06.740 --> 10:09.340
to the time stasis.

10:10.260 --> 10:10.860
You…

10:20.060 --> 10:20.700
I knew it.

10:21.740 --> 10:24.460
We Yu Clan are all fearless warriors.

10:35.700 --> 10:36.340
Shuo Xuan.

10:40.140 --> 10:40.940
Please take care of her.

10:43.540 --> 10:44.660
She is also my mother.

11:34.060 --> 11:34.780
Mother.

11:59.580 --> 12:00.260
Xiaoyuan.

12:01.820 --> 12:03.140
Go back to rest.

12:58.940 --> 12:59.780
Now,

13:01.020 --> 13:01.740
everything

13:03.580 --> 13:05.100
is finally over.

13:08.660 --> 13:10.460
At the grand ceremony,
the drums will sound.

13:12.620 --> 13:14.380
The flower will pass on.
The dancer will be found.

13:15.540 --> 13:17.500
Beautiful women will
sing harmonious songs.

13:20.260 --> 13:22.060
Spring orchids and autumn chrysanthemums

13:23.540 --> 13:25.020
shall never cease

13:27.940 --> 13:28.740
through the ages.

14:21.740 --> 14:22.500
Qingfei.

14:23.900 --> 14:25.900
Your left hand is about to rust.

14:44.540 --> 14:45.380
Qingfei.

14:45.980 --> 14:47.660
If you don't wake up,

14:48.500 --> 14:50.460
mushrooms will grow on you.

14:54.900 --> 14:55.660
Qingfei.

14:56.220 --> 14:58.100
Do you want to go bask in the sun?

14:59.220 --> 15:00.820
I'll take you out in a moment.

15:25.300 --> 15:27.420
It's finally over.

15:29.460 --> 15:30.020
Yes.

15:30.940 --> 15:32.500
The Yu clan has entered the time stasis.

15:33.420 --> 15:34.620
No disasters in the human world.

15:35.700 --> 15:37.220
This is the best possible ending.

15:44.260 --> 15:45.580
You have been greatly weakened.

15:46.260 --> 15:47.460
You must rest well.

15:53.580 --> 15:55.020
We've arrived at the wasteland.

16:03.780 --> 16:04.940
Do you remember, Xiu?

16:06.820 --> 16:08.060
This is where we met

16:08.860 --> 16:10.300
Zhaoyan and Little Yue.

16:13.500 --> 16:14.300
Back then,

16:15.660 --> 16:16.700
they were all with us.

16:29.140 --> 16:29.660
Everyone,

16:30.860 --> 16:31.660
thank you.

16:33.740 --> 16:34.980
Let's part ways from here.

16:40.100 --> 16:40.660
Miss Yue.

16:41.460 --> 16:42.220
Where are you going?

16:47.940 --> 16:49.300
Will you do something foolish?

16:51.860 --> 16:52.740
Of course not.

16:59.980 --> 17:01.260
People meet and part like duckweed.

17:02.100 --> 17:02.620
Don't force it.

17:05.579 --> 17:05.980
Little Yue.

17:07.660 --> 17:08.460
Take care.

17:10.460 --> 17:11.099
Xian Qing.

17:12.940 --> 17:13.540
Zhaoyan.

17:16.420 --> 17:17.020
Ming Xiu.

17:21.140 --> 17:22.260
You take care as well.

17:23.780 --> 17:24.460
You too.

18:21.100 --> 18:21.620
And you?

18:26.700 --> 18:27.260
I…

18:32.020 --> 18:33.340
I want to seek the art of eternal life.

18:37.860 --> 18:39.140
Maiming borrowed my life before.

18:40.340 --> 18:41.860
Although the curse has been lifted,

18:42.780 --> 18:44.260
the lifespan he took from me

18:45.180 --> 18:45.940
has not been returned.

18:46.900 --> 18:48.020
The time I have left

18:48.580 --> 18:49.420
is not much.

18:51.740 --> 18:52.980
If I were to die like this,

18:53.500 --> 18:55.220
even if fate allows us to meet again,

18:57.620 --> 18:58.940
I certainly would not remember

18:59.340 --> 19:00.900
the time I had with you.

19:04.060 --> 19:05.020
I will not accept that.

19:08.700 --> 19:09.540
I will go with you.

19:25.100 --> 19:25.580
And you, Xiu?

19:27.940 --> 19:28.740
I'll return to Mount Yuqing.

19:29.940 --> 19:31.820
You can have the Yunlai Stone.

19:38.420 --> 19:38.900
Xiu.

19:40.580 --> 19:41.420
Take care of yourself.

19:43.140 --> 19:44.340
Mind your own business.

19:45.620 --> 19:46.420
Miss Ming, take care.

19:48.060 --> 19:48.540
Goodbye.

20:05.940 --> 20:07.180
If we miss Miss Ming,

20:08.660 --> 20:10.140
we can go see her at Mount Yuqing.

20:12.060 --> 20:13.060
But Miss Yue…

20:18.700 --> 20:19.780
We'll meet again if fate allows.

20:24.140 --> 20:25.140
We have witnessed

20:25.340 --> 20:26.620
how much Miss Yue has grown.

21:03.570 --> 21:05.170
♪The sorrowful wind♪

21:05.170 --> 21:07.290
♪And the falling snow♪

21:07.800 --> 21:12.900
♪Can't bear to see your tears♪

21:14.840 --> 21:18.680
♪I can't be without you♪

21:19.190 --> 21:23.770
♪Take away my frail life♪

21:24.700 --> 21:29.640
♪Like a flower's reflection in a mirror♪

21:30.590 --> 21:35.870
♪Like hidden feelings
as sharp as icicles♪

21:37.270 --> 21:39.330
♪With the lightest whisper♪

21:39.330 --> 21:41.660
♪You make the harshest decision♪

21:41.660 --> 21:48.600
♪It's not different
from the extreme penalty♪

21:50.650 --> 21:54.950
♪If you really have the heart
to leave me alone♪

21:56.570 --> 22:02.200
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

22:02.200 --> 22:02.840
Master.

22:04.760 --> 22:05.560
I'm back.

22:07.550 --> 22:11.800
♪Even our hug feels unnatural♪

22:11.800 --> 22:12.760
During this time,

22:14.160 --> 22:17.480
I have been through a lot.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.600
And I finally understood

22:19.960 --> 22:21.840
why you gave up your life

22:22.840 --> 22:24.080
for the lives of others.

22:24.670 --> 22:31.400
♪If there's no hope for a reunion.
Don't eavesdrop on me in the dream♪

22:31.400 --> 22:32.320
Now,

22:33.160 --> 22:34.360
I think

22:36.680 --> 22:38.200
I've made the same decision as you.

22:42.000 --> 22:42.400
Right.

22:43.960 --> 22:44.840
As for Xian Qing.

22:45.680 --> 22:47.040
This thousand-year-old wolf demon

22:47.800 --> 22:49.080
had no desires before.

22:49.680 --> 22:50.560
But now,

22:50.840 --> 22:52.200
he also has someone he cares for.

22:53.360 --> 22:54.880
That he could end up with Zhaoyan,

22:56.800 --> 22:57.480
I think,

22:58.440 --> 22:59.760
is also a gift granted to him

23:00.960 --> 23:02.040
by the endless time.

23:16.960 --> 23:17.480
Master,

23:19.920 --> 23:20.800
Xiu

23:22.200 --> 23:22.920
has grown up.

23:23.960 --> 23:28.310
♪If you really have the heart
to leave me alone♪

23:29.660 --> 23:35.030
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

23:35.350 --> 23:40.270
♪What I thought would be evergreen
withers between my fingers♪

23:40.790 --> 23:45.850
♪Even our hug feels unnatural♪

23:46.490 --> 23:51.000
♪If it's all fate♪

23:52.190 --> 23:57.440
♪Don't question who has betrayed love♪

23:57.440 --> 24:00.220
♪If there's no hope for a reunion♪

24:00.220 --> 24:04.420
♪Don't eavesdrop on me in the dream♪

24:04.420 --> 24:08.860
♪Singing my yearning♪

24:11.710 --> 24:16.140
♪In the dream♪

24:18.330 --> 24:22.350
♪Singing my yearning♪

24:26.720 --> 24:27.800
I'm an old person.

24:29.240 --> 24:30.560
I will need you to take care of me.

24:33.040 --> 24:33.840
Okay.

24:35.480 --> 24:36.360
How is your health?

24:37.320 --> 24:37.760
Fine.

24:38.720 --> 24:41.000
I quite enjoy having
you take care of me.

24:44.320 --> 24:46.560
We should be near
the place in the legend now.

25:07.040 --> 25:09.880
This art of eternity
truly left no trace.

25:10.280 --> 25:11.600
We've been searching for days,

25:11.840 --> 25:12.760
but without success.

25:13.680 --> 25:15.520
I'm afraid we've started
this journey in vain.

25:18.000 --> 25:18.880
The world is vast.

25:19.840 --> 25:20.880
We will find it eventually.

25:23.880 --> 25:24.920
But I don't want anymore.

25:30.680 --> 25:32.800
Since it cannot be found,

25:33.280 --> 25:35.160
I will cultivate alongside you

25:36.040 --> 25:36.720
to seek immortality.

25:37.000 --> 25:37.360
How about it?

25:38.760 --> 25:40.040
Are you sure about this?

25:45.960 --> 25:48.480
Although this place is secluded,

25:48.840 --> 25:50.360
there are countless creatures here.

25:51.080 --> 25:53.920
These plants also seem especially lush.

25:55.040 --> 25:56.320
Is this the nimbus you spoke of?

25:59.080 --> 26:01.200
This is indeed a good
place for recuperating.

26:01.440 --> 26:01.840
Good.

26:02.520 --> 26:03.680
Then let's cultivate here.

26:07.560 --> 26:10.400
But I have no strength left now.

26:11.840 --> 26:13.680
I'm afraid I'll need you to help me up.

26:20.760 --> 26:22.480
You've lost all your strength.

26:24.200 --> 26:27.400
I guess you can't help me
with my hairpin anymore.

26:30.840 --> 26:31.480
Of course I can.

26:33.800 --> 26:34.960
But do you really understand

26:35.720 --> 26:37.320
the loyalty of the Wolf Tribe?

26:38.440 --> 26:40.360
We've been through so much.

26:41.080 --> 26:42.360
It's about time, isn't it?

28:13.560 --> 28:15.080
I have learned your purpose

28:15.080 --> 28:16.280
from the stream of memories.

28:17.320 --> 28:18.680
You wish to exchange
the life of Yue Jinzhao?

28:19.760 --> 28:20.240
Yes.

28:22.040 --> 28:23.440
I want Jinzhao to come back.

28:24.200 --> 28:25.320
If you have a wish,

28:26.000 --> 28:27.560
you must make a sacrifice.

28:28.240 --> 28:29.800
You can only exchange for his life

28:30.320 --> 28:33.600
at the cost of your existence.

28:35.120 --> 28:35.600
Okay.

28:37.200 --> 28:38.320
The so-called existence

28:39.600 --> 28:41.000
refers to all your memories

28:41.880 --> 28:44.520
and the memories others have of you.

28:45.520 --> 28:46.560
When your existence disappears,

28:47.320 --> 28:49.480
no one in this world will remember you.

28:51.800 --> 28:52.160
Okay.

28:54.080 --> 28:54.640
Jinzhao.

28:55.000 --> 28:56.560
If something happens to me,

28:56.880 --> 28:58.280
you must not exchange yourself for me.

28:58.480 --> 29:00.720
Because I don't want to forget you.

29:01.240 --> 29:01.880
Don't talk nonsense.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.600
All my memories

29:07.880 --> 29:09.680
are my time with Jinzhao.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.800
With him gone,

29:16.280 --> 29:18.080
my memory is meaningless.

29:18.080 --> 29:20.780
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

29:20.780 --> 29:25.800
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

29:25.800 --> 29:26.920
Jinzhao was smart

29:26.920 --> 29:29.280
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

29:29.280 --> 29:30.000
and impressive.

29:30.920 --> 29:33.220
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

29:33.800 --> 29:35.640
He was good at everything.

29:36.960 --> 29:37.840
He should live longer

29:38.600 --> 29:40.360
than merely four years.

29:42.790 --> 29:45.640
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

29:45.640 --> 29:46.360
I beg you.

29:47.840 --> 29:51.520
Bring him back.

29:51.880 --> 29:53.450
♪Over the time♪

29:53.450 --> 29:55.040
In this case,

29:56.080 --> 29:58.340
you already know the price.

30:01.320 --> 30:03.480
The disaster Zhu Yu
brought still lingers

30:05.440 --> 30:08.040
because I failed in my duty
as the Mist Soul guardian.

30:09.400 --> 30:11.080
I have failed the world,

30:11.680 --> 30:13.360
yet I am powerless to make amends.

30:13.800 --> 30:14.760
I can only make it up

30:15.480 --> 30:17.080
to Yue Jinzhao and Qi.

30:22.120 --> 30:23.640
Your life is already meager.

30:24.400 --> 30:25.800
The life you exchange for

30:26.600 --> 30:28.080
is bound to be short.

30:29.900 --> 30:32.360
♪Memories are flying by♪

30:32.360 --> 30:37.800
♪I'll follow you,
whether it's right or wrong♪

30:37.800 --> 30:39.000
If only there is someone else

30:40.200 --> 30:42.040
willing to exchange for Yue Jinzhao.

30:43.530 --> 30:46.890
♪We can drink together today♪

30:48.550 --> 30:51.880
♪I'll go through life and death
with you♪

30:51.880 --> 30:52.960
She will come.

30:52.960 --> 30:55.550
♪My love never stops♪

30:55.550 --> 30:58.240
♪No matter how bumpy
the road to our reunion is♪

30:58.240 --> 30:59.480
Use all my life

31:00.080 --> 31:00.880
and

31:01.400 --> 31:03.080
what she's willing to pay

31:04.200 --> 31:05.200
to get him back.

31:05.200 --> 31:08.080
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

31:08.080 --> 31:09.480
Since you've decided,

31:10.760 --> 31:11.880
we will start.

31:14.220 --> 31:15.690
♪Over the time♪

31:15.690 --> 31:17.670
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

31:17.670 --> 31:20.510
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

31:20.510 --> 31:23.880
♪Of being with you forever♪

31:23.880 --> 31:27.640
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

31:29.610 --> 31:36.320
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

31:36.320 --> 31:37.120
Will Jinzhao

31:39.500 --> 31:42.120
♪Miracle♪

31:42.120 --> 31:43.560
really forget me?

31:43.560 --> 31:49.070
♪I will protect you in my life.
That's my love for you♪

31:53.420 --> 31:56.580
♪Miracle♪

31:56.580 --> 31:58.730
♪I will protect you in my life♪

31:58.730 --> 32:02.120
♪That's my love for you♪

32:12.000 --> 32:12.760
Qingfei.

32:13.640 --> 32:15.600
This dragonfly is quite pretty.

32:19.080 --> 32:20.080
Strange.

32:20.600 --> 32:22.200
I just can't remember

32:22.480 --> 32:23.760
who promised me

32:23.760 --> 32:26.120
to make a hundred
grass dragonflies for me.

32:31.040 --> 32:31.880
Qingfei.

32:33.560 --> 32:35.000
Wake up.

32:37.480 --> 32:39.000
Come look for that person with me.

32:40.880 --> 32:41.800
Qingfei.

32:43.040 --> 32:44.440
Wake up, please.

32:52.680 --> 32:53.680
Sister.

32:57.480 --> 32:59.640
Wake up.

33:02.080 --> 33:03.160
Strange.

33:03.720 --> 33:05.240
Why am I crying?

34:06.280 --> 34:06.720
Everyone.

34:08.320 --> 34:11.520
Today, I'll tell you about
the battle of Zangfeng Plains.

34:13.280 --> 34:16.239
(Hongyi Storytelling Pavilion)
In that battle,

34:17.520 --> 34:19.880
to save the common folk,

34:20.159 --> 34:23.679
the Zhengwu Alliance fought
bravely to their demise.

34:24.320 --> 34:24.840
Everyone.

34:25.600 --> 34:28.239
Do you know who is
most worthy of mention?

34:28.239 --> 34:31.120
Who?

34:31.120 --> 34:32.560
The one most worthy of mention

34:32.679 --> 34:35.520
is the man who risked his own life

34:35.679 --> 34:37.199
to fight the evil,

34:37.639 --> 34:38.719
Mr. Ju.

34:40.440 --> 34:42.159
Mr. Ju?

34:42.560 --> 34:43.480
You don't know him?

34:44.639 --> 34:46.239
Let me tell you about him.

34:52.679 --> 34:53.280
Boy.

34:56.600 --> 34:57.240
Are you okay?

34:57.800 --> 34:58.520
I'm fine.

34:59.160 --> 35:01.200
I'm sorry, Miss.

35:01.200 --> 35:02.680
I bumped into you.

35:03.320 --> 35:03.880
It's alright.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.200
Be careful in the future.

35:05.400 --> 35:06.600
Don't get yourself hurt.

35:07.000 --> 35:07.480
That's right.

35:07.880 --> 35:08.840
You are a brave young man.

35:09.160 --> 35:10.280
You need to learn to protect yourself.

35:12.320 --> 35:13.600
Here, your toy.

35:14.520 --> 35:15.800
Thank you, Mister.

35:21.160 --> 35:21.920
Mister.

35:22.800 --> 35:24.640
Have we met before?

35:25.760 --> 35:26.520
I don't think so.

35:28.320 --> 35:29.080
I see.

35:30.160 --> 35:30.920
Please excuse me.

35:58.880 --> 35:59.520
Xiu.

36:03.120 --> 36:04.080
After so many years,

36:04.440 --> 36:06.240
you're still as lively as ever, uncle.

36:07.360 --> 36:09.240
It's true that the bad ones
always have a long life.

36:10.800 --> 36:11.400
But,

36:12.000 --> 36:13.480
why did you ask to meet here?

36:14.360 --> 36:15.280
It was my idea.

36:16.280 --> 36:18.480
Back then, we used to boat
under the moonlight here.

36:18.880 --> 36:20.080
But I have yet to see

36:20.080 --> 36:21.350
the daytime scenery.

37:19.210 --> 37:20.610
♪Stars twinkle♪

37:20.610 --> 37:22.610
♪Falling on the lake's surface♪

37:23.400 --> 37:24.610
♪The bright moon gleams♪

37:24.610 --> 37:26.610
♪Illuminating your tender eyes♪

37:27.310 --> 37:29.510
♪Hearing the soft heartbeat by my side♪

37:29.510 --> 37:33.620
♪I make a wish deep within♪

37:35.610 --> 37:36.850
♪Flowers sway gently♪

37:36.850 --> 37:38.950
♪Our eyes are full of affection♪

37:38.950 --> 37:40.870
♪In a low murmur♪

37:40.870 --> 37:42.870
♪We express
our entwined hearts' desires♪

37:42.870 --> 37:46.290
♪Joyfully going
through the endless years♪

37:46.290 --> 37:48.570
♪A breeze stirs the heartstrings♪

37:48.570 --> 37:51.060
♪Red thread twines around fingers♪

37:51.060 --> 37:52.920
♪We've witnessed blossoms♪

37:52.920 --> 37:54.920
♪And braved through snow storms♪

37:54.920 --> 37:58.930
♪Each moment is hard to forget♪

37:58.930 --> 38:01.620
♪The joys, the innocence,
the fearlessness♪

38:01.620 --> 38:04.090
♪And our very images♪

38:04.090 --> 38:06.090
♪All carefully cherished♪

38:06.090 --> 38:09.170
♪I wish to stand side by side with you♪

38:09.170 --> 38:11.510
♪To watch the sun rise and fall♪

38:11.510 --> 38:13.210
♪And the seasons change♪

38:13.210 --> 38:16.020
♪When the wind kisses us softly♪

38:16.020 --> 38:18.020
♪We snuggle and cuddle♪

38:18.350 --> 38:22.360
♪And you embrace me in your dream♪

38:22.360 --> 38:25.400
♪I wish to hold your hand♪

38:25.400 --> 38:28.050
♪Inviting a spring breeze to become♪

38:28.050 --> 38:29.330
♪An eternal pledge♪

38:29.330 --> 38:32.500
♪I wish the wind could hear♪

38:32.500 --> 38:35.410
♪Our loyalty and love for each other♪

38:35.410 --> 38:37.170
♪It's my wish♪

38:37.170 --> 38:40.180
♪And my sole wish for this life♪

